{"5061870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Man Running", "steam_appid": 5061870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5063710], "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/a983ae4111a9a1382bb791bebbcbf77d.poster.avif?t=1788236713\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/a983ae4111a9a1382bb791bebbcbf77d.webm?t=1788236713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/a983ae4111a9a1382bb791bebbcbf77d.mp4?t=1788236713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN FOR YOUR LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rooftops are collapsing. The horde is closing in. Your friends are absolutely not helping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Man Running is a fast, physical rooftop elimination runner. Build momentum across procedural routes while a 240-zombie horde erases every mistake.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/25cb5bcddd825756f173d9e3bc85f8e3.poster.avif?t=1788236713\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/25cb5bcddd825756f173d9e3bc85f8e3.webm?t=1788236713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/25cb5bcddd825756f173d9e3bc85f8e3.mp4?t=1788236713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEP MOVING</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Vault, slide, wall-run, wall-jump, grab ledges, and double-jump to stay ahead.</li><li>Smash through props and hazards across changing rooftop courses.</li><li>Tackle, grab, spin, shield, and throw other runners off the safest line.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/4a957a02fcb21f409771e4d1fa4d23a4.poster.avif?t=1788236713\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/4a957a02fcb21f409771e4d1fa4d23a4.webm?t=1788236713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/4a957a02fcb21f409771e4d1fa4d23a4.mp4?t=1788236713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SOLO, CO-OP, OR PVP</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solo: chase a high score with momentum multipliers, pickups, and two banked respawns.</li><li>Co-op: survive as a team, locally or online.</li><li>PvP: battle locally or online in quick, first-to-five elimination matches.</li><li>Mix couch and remote runners in the same online session.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/b7e85cbb92a8e8d019966fc8e550c994.poster.avif?t=1788236713\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/b7e85cbb92a8e8d019966fc8e550c994.webm?t=1788236713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/b7e85cbb92a8e8d019966fc8e550c994.mp4?t=1788236713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT DIRTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean line is good. Ruining someone else’s is better. Charge a tackle, drag a downed rival, use another runner as a shield, or throw them straight into trouble.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/357872a0c07b55b4ddb351829cfb9206.poster.avif?t=1788236713\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/357872a0c07b55b4ddb351829cfb9206.webm?t=1788236713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/357872a0c07b55b4ddb351829cfb9206.mp4?t=1788236713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Procedurally assembled rooftops with alternate routes, hazards, breakable scenery, and startled pigeons.</li><li>Friends-only Steam lobbies, invites, and relay networking for online co-op and PvP.</li><li>20 Steam Achievements tied to movement, survival, destruction, and glorious bad behavior.</li><li>Gritty low-poly, PS1-inspired cityscapes packed with neon, rust, grime, and industrial danger.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep moving. Fight dirty. Try not to become lunch.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/a15b186cc4d0c5dc87cf024627114eb0.poster.avif?t=1788236713\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/a15b186cc4d0c5dc87cf024627114eb0.webm?t=1788236713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/a15b186cc4d0c5dc87cf024627114eb0.mp4?t=1788236713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5061870/extras/1dc3bf7625378407592f1038f7c0b517.poster.avif?t=1788236713\" wid